  ('being-a-thoughtful-guest', 197, 'Notice whether the family says grace or pauses before eating, and wait quietly with them.'),
  ('being-a-thoughtful-guest', 198, 'Help hang a paper garland with the household when they decorate for a winter holiday, if invited.'),
  ('being-a-thoughtful-guest', 199, 'Check which pans and bowls you may use before you start cooking in someone else''s kitchen.'),
  ('being-a-thoughtful-guest', 200, 'Send a photo from the visit to your host with a line about why it made you smile.'),
  ('being-a-thoughtful-guest', 201, 'Before a visit, find out whether the household takes shoes off indoors, so you can wear socks you''re happy to show.'),
  ('being-a-thoughtful-guest', 202, 'Watch how the household handles small things, like whether doors stay closed, and match it.'),
  ('being-a-thoughtful-guest', 203, 'Dry the dishes while your host washes, chatting about the evening as you go.'),
